313">Cuzick (1985)</xref>.</p></fn><fn id="tfn5-ehp-117-1313"><label>d</label><p>During the week before the start of use of the passive air sampler.</p></fn><fn id="tfn6-ehp-117-1313"><label>e</label><p>The value was set to 0 for women for whom car was not the most frequent means of transportation.</p></fn><fn id="tfn7-ehp-117-1313"><label>f</label><p>Average during the period of use of the passive air sampler of the measurements from the permanent monitoring station closest from the home address.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t3-ehp-117-1313" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Associations between benzene levels during pregnancy and measurements of the offspring at birth.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th colspan="2" align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1">Gestational age&#x02013;adjusted models<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn9-ehp-117-1313">a</xref><hr/></th><th colspan="2" align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1">Fully adjusted models<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn10-ehp-117-1313">b</xref><hr/></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Measure</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No.</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mean &#x000b1; SD</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x003b2;<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn11-ehp-117-1313">c</xref> (95% CI)</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>p</italic>-Value</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x003b2;<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn11-ehp-117-1313">c</xref> (95% CI)</th><th align="center" valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>p</italic>-Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan="7"